680201,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20268,"speakerName":"Xudong","textMapHash":1704853994,"text":"Parvaneh, is there really no other way to do this?","nextNodeIds":[721680202]},{"nodeId":721680202,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20270,"speakerName":"Parvaneh","textMapHash":1514265274,"text":"My book only mentions this one way.","nextNodeIds":[721680203]},{"nodeId":721680203,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20269,"speakerName":"Julie","textMapHash":600403138,"text":"Heh, if only it was just a bunch of monsters barring our path...","nextNodeIds":[721680204]},{"nodeId":721680204,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":512204514,"text":"Are these the Sakura Blooms you've been looking for?","nextNodeIds":[721680205]},{"nodeId":721680205,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20268,"speakerName":"Xudong","textMapHash":59996354,"text":"Ah! Yes, that they are! And this color...","nextNodeIds":[721680206]},{"nodeId":721680206,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20269,"speakerName":"Julie","textMapHash":3566434658,"text":"Woohoo! Guess we can finally eat now!","nextNodeIds":[721680207]},{"nodeId":721680207,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20270,"speakerName":"Parvaneh","textMapHash":1346234602,"text":"Wait, you've already passed through that barrier? Did you use the method I told you about?","nextNodeIds":[721680208]},{"nodeId":721680208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":205157002,"text":"That I did.","nextNodeIds":[721680209]},{"nodeId":721680209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20270,"speakerName":"Parvaneh","textMapHash":3587150562,"text":"Could you tell me where you found that Thunder Sakura Bough?","nextNodeIds":[721680210]},{"nodeId":721680210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20270,"speakerName":"Parvaneh","textMapHash":872463490,"text":"When you touched that Bough, how did the Electrogranum come to rest upon you?","nextNodeIds":[721680211]},{"nodeId":721680211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20270,"speakerName":"Parvaneh","textMapHash":575446770,"text":"...Wait, I'm sorry, let me pull out my notebook. So, did you feel anything after the Electrogranum attached itself to you? And...","nextNodeIds":[721680212]},{"nodeId":721680212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20268,"speakerName":"Xudong","textMapHash":731170234,"text":"Parvaneh, please, give this Traveler a moment. They just helped us out... I think your research can wait a bit, right?","nextNodeIds":[721680213]},{"nodeId":721680213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20268,"speakerName":"Xudong","textMapHash":3641698730,"text":"Thank you very much, Traveler. As we agreed, you will be paid.","nextNodeIds":[721680214]},{"nodeId":721680214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20268,"speakerName":"Xudong","textMapHash":2039965034,"text":"But before that, just wait here with us for a while. I believe I'll be able to make a dish with the Sakura Blooms you brought.","nextNodeIds":[721680215]},{"nodeId":721680215,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20268,"speakerName":"Xudong","textMapHash":1427595922,"text":"I've heard of an Inazuman specialty known as Sakura Tempura. I suppose now's the time to try it out.","nextNodeIds":[721680216]},{"nodeId":721680216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20268,"speakerName":"Xudong","textMapHash":2061771442,"text":"Give me a while to prepare. It shouldn't take too long, so come find me in a moment.","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7216802,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["101517"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_DEL_ALL_SPECIFIC_PACK_ITEM"},{"LNHLPKELCAL":["3","133220448"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_NOTIFY_GROUP_LUA"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIG